    ("UQFF buoyancy-shell modified growth (this work, L27+L28)",
     +0.0,  -0.030,  0.000, "S8",
     "UQFF Map sections 8, 12; L27 envelope + L28 r_cb closure; "
     "geometric correction to growth ONLY, no lensing-power shift"),
